    trong 7 gi\xE2y, t\u0103ng 20% bonusMoveSpeed v\xE0 bonusAttackSpeed cho to\xE0n
    b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED3ng minh b\xEAn trong, v\xE0 gi\u1EA3m 20% baseMoveSpeed v\xE0
    baseAttackSpeed c\u1EE7a to\xE0n b\u1ED9 k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch b\xEAn trong.\""
